<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Oncativo</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1830</span> · Also known as Battle of Laguna Larga · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argentine-civil-wars">Argentine Civil Wars</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Oncativo, also called Laguna Larga, was fought on 25 February 1830 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cordoba">Córdoba</a> Province, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argentina">Argentina</a>, where <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jose-maria-paz">José María Paz</a>'s Unitarian army again defeated <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/juan-facundo-quiroga">Juan Facundo Quiroga</a>. The victory let Paz install Unitarian governors in the interior provinces, which formed the League of the Interior under his command later that year.</p></div>
